{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1240031-a-question-concerning-space","id":1240031,"title":"A question concerning Space","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-07-29T07:15:58-07:00","id":1240031,"title":"A question concerning Space","content":"So far as I can tell, an Apprentice of Space has extremely limited options for casting at sympathetic range, basically the stereotypically &quot;voodoo doll,&quot; incorporating the victim's hair, nails, or clothing. I know it's possible to move a connection from one thing to another, but that connection has to exist in the first place. One way or another, it seems to take a lot of work to get the needed connection, and a lot of chicanery if you're trying to be inconspicuous.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-29T07:21:30-07:00","id":1240035,"title":"","content":"Yes. What's your question?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-29T07:46:09-07:00","id":1240043,"title":"","content":"Well, I wanted to know if I was understanding the rules correctly, or if I was missing some option.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-29T08:00:14-07:00","id":1240052,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LadyLens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1240031-a-question-concerning-space#post1240031\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So far as I can tell, an Apprentice of Space has extremely limited options for casting at sympathetic range, basically the stereotypically &amp;quot;voodoo doll,&amp;quot; incorporating the victim's hair, nails, or clothing. I know it's possible to move a connection from one thing to another, but that connection has to exist in the first place. One way or another, it seems to take a lot of work to get the needed connection, and a lot of chicanery if you're trying to be inconspicuous.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, how else <i>should</i> it be? Sympathetic connections are no joke - otherwise any Mage could remote-nuke anyone they felt like.<br /> <br /> By requiring something with a connection, this give actors a way to manage their vulnerability to these types of attacks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-29T08:44:19-07:00","id":1240062,"title":"","content":"Also it's not really that much of an impediment to casting on those people or places you'll probably want to cast on the most such as your cabal or sanctum. A Mage with Space is a lot like a spider with a web, they sit in the midst of their own Sympathetic connections and when they sense a vibration in them as someone touches something they're connected to they rush out to investigate. When they get there, if they want to trap their prey, they're going to have to spin new webbing or restructure the web around the prey if they want to actually catch and deal with it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-30T10:06:53-07:00","id":1240489,"title":"","content":"You only need a Representation Sympathy yantra for symphatetic casting. A representation sympathy can be even a picture of a person, and if you know how they look you can paint a picture (nothing says it has to be a good picture). Personally I'd even accept almost everything than can represent a person to be enough to serve as the bare minimum to use sympathetic casting, for instance a phone number.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2636-menace","name":"Menace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2636_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"527"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-30T10:08:04-07:00","id":1240491,"title":"","content":"The yantra's easy. The connection's the hard part.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-30T10:18:35-07:00","id":1240497,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LadyLens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1240031-a-question-concerning-space?p=1240491#post1240491\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The yantra's easy. The connection's the hard part.</div> </div> </div> </div>This, so much. It's seems so hard for so many to get that you need both Sympathetic Connection and a Sympathetic Yantra to cast spells sympathetically.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/523-poseur","name":"Poseur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"375"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-30T11:05:02-07:00","id":1240517,"title":"","content":"Even a starting Mage can grab Sympathetic Connections though, you only need Space 2. You can use Correspondence to figure out the strongest connection that won't be missed as well, or the strongest connection period and use Borrow Thread's Reach option to completely copy the connection.<br /> <br /> Say you stumble on a murder scene and find a bloody knife, you can borrow the connection from the blood to its owner, and using the blood as material sympathy you can either locate the person who was killed, or scry on them. You don't need to know their identity, though not knowing does raise the Sympathetic Withstand level by one. You can probably pick up and copy the fading Sympathetic connections from the body as well (And if you can't then that's a clue that you're not dealing with a normal murder), and their murderer will probably be near the top of that list of connections. Borrow Threads again, create a symbolic yantra of the murderer where details can be somewhat fudged but throwing in as much accurate information as you have and you can then track that person down too and decide what to do about them.<br /> <br /> The real roadblock here is spell control, but all's that means is you may want to spend some dice and Reach on these temporary Sympathetic Connection spells for as long as you estimate you'll need them and then unsafely relinquish them with a point of WP.<br /> <br /> tl;dr Sympathetic Connections aren't as big of a hurdle as people seem to think they are.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2632,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","user":"Mrmdubois","date":". 07-30-2018, 02:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-30T12:34:54-07:00","id":1240542,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Poseur</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1240031-a-question-concerning-space?p=1240497#post1240497\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This, so much. It's seems so hard for so many to get that you need both Sympathetic Connection and a Sympathetic Yantra to cast spells sympathetically.</div> </div> </div> </div>The rules on sympathetic casting are poorly written. I just reread the paragraph. Yeah. There's a whole one paragraph on the subject, and the need for a connection separate from the Yantra is never actually directly stated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-30T12:59:43-07:00","id":1240553,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LadyLens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1240031-a-question-concerning-space?p=1240542#post1240542\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The rules on sympathetic casting are poorly written. I just reread the paragraph. Yeah. There's a whole one paragraph on the subject, and the need for a connection separate from the Yantra is never actually directly stated.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> No, it's not poorly written. English is not my native language but it's quite impossibly to misread if one reads it.<br /> The attainment itself says on p.193: <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> &quot;The mage requires a sympathetic<br /> connection to the subject, <i><b>and</b></i> a Yantra symbolizing that subject<br /> to use as a focus for the spell.&quot; [emphasis mine] </div> </div> </div>Also, no where in the spellcasting, or the Sympathetic Yantra does it say that it could be used for Sympathetic spellcasting. The spellcasting rules even point out to see the attainment for specific details. The yantra itself even states, <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> or access an Attainment to use her own sympathetic connection<br /> to the subject in order to cast across Space or Time. </div> </div> </div>Nowhere is it hinted that you could cast without a Connection.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/523-poseur","name":"Poseur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"375"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-30T13:11:12-07:00","id":1240557,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Poseur</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1240031-a-question-concerning-space?p=1240553#post1240553\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No, it's not poorly written. English is not my native language but it's quite impossibly to misread if one reads it.<br /> The attainment itself says on p.193:</div> </div> </div> </div>I was reading the section on Sympathy, page 172, which is where iId expect to find the rules on sympathetic casting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-30T13:19:01-07:00","id":1240561,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LadyLens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1240031-a-question-concerning-space?p=1240557#post1240557\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was reading the section on Sympathy, page 172, which is where iId expect to find the rules on sympathetic casting.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Again noting points to you being able to cast it sympathetically there, but it does lead you toward the actual rules, ergo the attainment in question.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/523-poseur","name":"Poseur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"375"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-31T01:06:13-07:00","id":1240756,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LadyLens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1240031-a-question-concerning-space?p=1240557#post1240557\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was reading the section on Sympathy, page 172, which is where iId expect to find the rules on sympathetic casting.</div> </div> </div> </div>That might be the problem. Sympathy in itself is much more important and a much bigger part of Space and Mage in general than sympathetic casting is. You can do a LOT of stuff by meddeling with sympathetic connections completely without any sympathetic casting. The sympathatic casting is kind of a niche of Space. An important niche, but not the reason you should invest into the Arcanum in the first place.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11939-hardcorehannes","name":"HardcoreHannes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"200"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}